<title>TAJIKISTAN: Tajik Jan-May industrial output down 9.1 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Tajik Jan-May industrial output down 9.1 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>DUSHANBE 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tajikistan's industrial production in the first five months of this year was 9.1 percent lower than the same year-ago period, the State Statistics</p>
<p>Committee said on Monday.</p>
<p>TAJIKISTAN INDUSTRIAL OUTPUT Jan-May 97  Jan-Apr 97  Jan-May 96</p>
<p>    year-on-year pct change	-9.1	 -10.8	-24.8</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
